Time complexity of this snippet as a function of $n$?
```python
for i in range(n):
    for j in range(i):
        total += 1
```

Time complexity as a function of $n$, if `work()` takes $O(1)$?
```python
for i in range(1, n + 1):
    for j in range(0, n, i):
        work()
```

How much call-stack space does this recursive function use for input $n$?
```python
def fact(n):
    return 1 if n <= 1 else n * fact(n - 1)
```
